BVC — UNOFFICIAL REBUILD

This repository is an unofficial, non-affiliated rebuild of the badvape-v2
runtime (https://github.com/4fundsagent-source/badvape-v2) with all
license/credential systems removed.

Upstream code remains the property of its original authors and is subject to
its original license terms. This fork makes no claim of ownership over
upstream code, assets, or branding.

The BVC modifications (loader, bootstrap, rebranding, license removal) are
provided as-is, without warranty of any kind. Use at your own risk.
